# AnthroFlowAI — .gitignore for the Chapter 5 (UDE zinc cycle) code release
#
# WHITELIST. Everything is ignored by default. Re-included below: the code and
# results used by Chapter 5 (chapters/ch4_ude_zinc.tex) and its appendix
# (appendices/app_ch4_estimation.tex), plus the experiments reserved for the
# thesis discussion chapter (Chapter 6) in CH4_DISCUSSION_REVISION_INSTRUCTIONS.md
# section 3 and CH4_DRAFT_NOTES.md section 5.6. To publish another file, add a
# '!' line for it in the right block. Generated 2026-10-09.
#
# NOT PUBLISHABLE (no ILZSG permission): zinc_dataset*.xlsx and the original
# result files that store values of the observed record. Their masked copies
# are published under final_model/masked_results/ (see
# reproducibility/restore_observed.py). The final block re-ignores the
# originals and overrides any whitelist line above it.

# ---- 1. ignore everything at the repository root -------------------------
/*

# ---- 2. root files: environment and docs ---------------------------------
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/requirements.txt
!/.python-version

# ---- 3. final_model: model code and work-package drivers -----------------
!/final_model/
/final_model/*
# core model, ridge-regression comparator and the anchor driver
!/final_model/zinc_colloc_v5.py
!/final_model/zinc_baseline.py
!/final_model/run_anchor.py
# lab modules (import-time patches used by the drivers below)
!/final_model/zinc_A_lab.py
!/final_model/zinc_agg_lab.py
!/final_model/zinc_alias_lab.py
!/final_model/zinc_alpha_lab.py
!/final_model/zinc_cf_lab.py
